https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

This license also covers the author-created derived HOT-lane pricing model
workbook, formula export, and value export in `data/derived_model_workbook/`
only to the extent they consist of author-created selection, cleaning,
tabulation, model formulas, elasticity calculations, or analysis controlled
by the paper authors or repository maintainers.

## Materials Not Relicensed

This repository license does not apply to:

- The publication PDF under `paper/`, which retains its publisher,
  repository, or manuscript terms.
- Raw MnPASS, MnDOT, Metropolitan Council, transponder, loop-detector,
  trip-table, corridor-demand, travel-time, traffic-operations, or other
  public-agency/source data.
- Microsoft Excel, Solver, LibreOffice, OpenXML, CSV, or other
  vendor/runtime/file-format structures and application metadata.
- Drafts, review letters, submission files, generated figure files, cited
  references, and other third-party or externally controlled materials.

## Software Boundary

No executable software, scripts, notebooks, model source code, simulation
code, or paper-specific runtime code are staged in this repository. This root
license therefore grants no separate software license.
